[{"title":"有背师者索题东皋书屋","author":"郑善夫","text":"东皋书屋傍风云，翠筱红蕖卧典坟。\n请君终学壶丘子，汧水鲵桓恐未闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20090,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至日","author":"郑善夫","text":"玄冥久不行冬令，瘴雾蛮烟泥杀人。\n恶草翻翻长至日，未看兰蕙转阳春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20091,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次素翁临沧亭","author":"郑善夫","text":"沧海鲸波天汉长，壶公东影拂扶桑。\n彤云彩雾行空壁，此是人间素老乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20092,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滩上","author":"郑善夫","text":"雪喷雷轰三百滩，临川力拟障回澜。\n淜奔险过瞿塘峡，细看中流砥柱湍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20093,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴门送黄明甫佥事赴岭南二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"吴门海风吹白波，岁晏离城可奈何。\n明到罗浮避冰雪，还君及早播阳和。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20094,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴门送黄明甫佥事赴岭南二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"江头日暮歌欲罢，告诉不尽哀情多。\n岭南自古炎蒸地，君去风霜合若何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20095,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惠山吟","author":"郑善夫","text":"去年曾饮中泠水，今日初尝第二泉。\n我有灵泉甘比蜜，无名应是在山偏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20096,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"延陵送刘克柔","author":"郑善夫","text":"延陵四月新水生，延陵江上送君行。\n行过长淮莫停耳，淮南淮北鹧鸪声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20097,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王山二绝 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"怀玉山前黄叶深，远天烽火上人心。\n不知何处歌都护，拍断尊前梁父吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20098,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王山二绝 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"十月玉山寒雨生，万峰叠叠更分明。\n长溪浅溆从容满，冷蕊枯荄次第荣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20099,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画者","author":"郑善夫","text":"近爱钱塘孙画师，江山花木乱生姿。\n正愁京洛风尘急，却耐庞眉歌紫芝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20100,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赤城","author":"郑善夫","text":"天台山前黄鹄飞，仙人城阙赤霞围。\n最怜谢女蓬莱去，未识人间马子微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20101,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送沈一归闽","author":"郑善夫","text":"乌石山傍思蕨薇，还家头白故人稀。\n溟溟苦海沙棠棹，几处风波他是非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20102,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瓠子河遇叶六","author":"郑善夫","text":"草草逢君瓠子河，河水瀁瀁柰君何。\n云山涕泪渭城曲，天地争回易水歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20103,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"歌风台 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"陆贾诗书叔孙礼，犹能润色汉乾坤。\n尔曹未是真王佐，威凤文鹓未得驯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20104,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"歌风台 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"大风之计在四方，岂意牝晨祸萧墙。\n身后貔虎尽食邑，左袒危乎仗彼苍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20105,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄黄明甫佥宪 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"颇忆故人黄小江，为官三载帛书荒。\n闽中幽事笑杀汝，麦饭藜羹薜荔裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20106,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄黄明甫佥宪 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"槟榔不过南诏驿，五岭冰霜今已多。\n岁晏诗篇尚记不，吴门海风生白波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20107,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿石门晦翁读书处 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"石门抱被云湿衣，流水聒耳无是非。\n海潮夜语梅花戌，起看扶桑朝日辉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20108,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿石门晦翁读书处 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"筹峰南下枫林西，岩阁千盘平翠微。\n云踪不见朱夫子，尸祝能谈刘布衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20109,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悟道松","author":"郑善夫","text":"玉柱峰头悟道松，根株岁久化为龙。\n若比茅山左纽桧，大千世界极鸿濛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20110,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游丹青阁读旧还怀许黄门启衷","author":"郑善夫","text":"风流不见许黄门，文字丹青阁尚存。\n最怜佳句车盘驿，黄犊青山何处村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20111,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太山三绝 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"巨灵盘盘阊阖门，日观峰头玉册存。\n黄岘西行看落日，碧霞南面拜元君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20112,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太山三绝 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"秦皇自谓功无量，拟揭空碑古帝前。\n磨崔小篆三千字，何似开元十四年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20113,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太山三绝 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"苦忆太山孙处士，春秋三传尚须编。\n只今四海无青眼，欲向何门乞俸钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20114,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读汉书四绝 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"邓禹数言天下计，定功端合首云台。\n牛鼎终非真会合，中兴不复食盐梅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20115,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读汉书四绝 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"子陵不废桐江钓，才力还堪比傅岩。\n汉室规模故人意，只馀糠籺落空谈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20116,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读汉书四绝 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"不及辽东管幼安，龙翔凤举出人间。\n东京窃笑三君辈，风节何禆末路难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20117,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读汉书四绝 其四","author":"郑善夫","text":"建武闭关示无外，后来夸者却开边。\n虎头何物飞食肉，西山康居三十年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20118,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河道","author":"郑善夫","text":"金陵方物上楼船，州县流传则例钱。\n圣主戎衣无盗贼，山东河道避冰鲜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20119,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙湫","author":"郑善夫","text":"龙湫瀑流转怒雷，回风散作灵雾飞。\n青雯倒挂鸿濛练，断尽天孙云锦机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20120,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沿溪见白蘋盛开","author":"郑善夫","text":"江深木落见蘋花，千涧秋容尔自佳。\n不随秾李分春事，要接寒梅成岁华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20121,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天台","author":"郑善夫","text":"崩湍转瀑下龙湫，皛皛银河綵雾浮。\n履险能无伯昏分，等閒来往石梁游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20122,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读松江渔翁传","author":"郑善夫","text":"垂钓松江三十年，澡身浴德意仙仙。\n那能心迹俱忘后，共女中流歌扣舷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20123,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吕徽之","author":"郑善夫","text":"平生意气吕夫子，遁迹空山薇蕨春。\n不分弱小与强国，独操鱼钓寓经纶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20124,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元天台戌妇不知其姓名有殊色千户长欲夺之不可盗械其夫阵亡时守囚者颂其系且恤之至意在妇也久且左其夫令闻之妇妇曰君以妾故至此妾顾可负君耶遂弃儿女自投于百步石厓下柴立湍激中死数日不仆当路闻者为释其夫囚仍立石旌其烈石在紫阳神化之处今杳然蓁莽也余过天台访而吊之","author":"郑善夫","text":"台山名姝人共悲，杀身千古怨娥眉。\n不道激湍无独立，桁杨夫婿已全归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20125,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠族人栗斋侍御","author":"郑善夫","text":"露公之后世多贤，侍御才名英妙年。\n总见风霜上容色，更期抟击向秋天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20126,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青野堂成二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"小隐堂开青野上，鹡鸰鸂鶒傍人初。\n安身正学周夫子，庭草芊芊费剪除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20127,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青野堂成二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"不厌芳华耽寂寞，江湖廊庙本同机。\n明时正好兴周道，要识莘磻是汝师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20128,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"班玉杖歌二首赠木虚 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"阿罗掌上千年物，信是蓬山绿玉枝。\n拄到中天斡元气，乾旋坤转莫知谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20129,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"班玉杖歌二首赠木虚 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"君家拄杖班龙质，十二星精光怪多。\n直教腾踏风云去，王道平平奈尔何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20130,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至日 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"沧江病里逢南至，化国欣看日线长。\n未堪取醉酬佳节，恐碍垂貂梦紫皇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20131,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至日 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"江南气候异京师，天道流行动失时。\n柳条梅蕊相催迸，蛱蝶黄鹂未入枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20132,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠樗翁","author":"郑善夫","text":"樗老钓矶淘水曲，渔竿独抱弄沧波。\n经纶老手终自惜，鼍掣鲸翻奈尔何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20133,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送平厓侍御使山东 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"尔往乘骢山海东，赤霞心捧大明宫。\n腰间绣斧横金枘，白日青天意气雄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20134,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送平厓侍御使山东 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"鳌峰乌石残芳迹，天府云台秪薄游。\n尧舜山林余且隐，伊周事业汝须谋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20135,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送平厓侍御使山东 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"孔林东奠龟蒙山，阙里长存天地间。\n要得吾儒振羽翼，迷方回首圣贤关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20136,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送平厓侍御使山东 其四","author":"郑善夫","text":"八神长呵封禅文，鱼鸟能符七十君。\n谁令先帝终巡幸，御帐亲团龙虎军。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20137,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送平厓侍御使山东 其五","author":"郑善夫","text":"殷浩坟前乌夜啼，饮牛那复鲁门西。\n我愧延陵吴季子，将无佩剑慰冥栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20138,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵咏 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"金陵佳气郁崔嵬，钟阜龙蟠阴殿开。\n万里山河陵阙脉，千年松柏栋梁材。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20139,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵咏 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"皇皇嗣圣造乾坤，靖难勋臣有特恩。\n王魏多知权所重，夷齐解事丧其元。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20140,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵咏 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"靖难相传是佛缘，浮屠九级答诸天。\n琉璃力尽金银帑，黎庶身涂十八年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20141,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵咏 其四","author":"郑善夫","text":"闽粤犹传汤大夫，残山振海定皇舆。\n当年肘后悬金印，今日人间卖玉鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20142,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵咏 其五","author":"郑善夫","text":"鄱阳战罢录功臣，赳赳中山第一人。\n不识汉家同用武，云台颠倒序元勋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20143,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵咏 其六","author":"郑善夫","text":"祀典春秋享帝王，汉高俎豆有辉光。\n皇王帝伯原功德，战伐何如揖让长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20144,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何岭见杜鹃花","author":"郑善夫","text":"青龙白虎事非幻，石室丹厓路不赊。\n一枕却成尘土梦，碧山开尽杜鹃花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20145,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人游新安","author":"郑善夫","text":"送君南向婺星源，三十二峰云色连。\n苍龙白鹤时来往，羽盖银幢下九天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20146,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岘山","author":"郑善夫","text":"吴兴霅水水倒飞，上菰下菰歌正悲。\n江汉有谁羊叔子，岘山先勒去思碑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20147,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蜀中歌","author":"郑善夫","text":"云涛雪浪通牛渚，杳杳飞槎天汉行。\n芝殿蕊宫连栈起，成都今去问君平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20148,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行见懒椿","author":"郑善夫","text":"懒椿一树与松长，丽蕊秋掀红翠香。\n爱尔未知谁更懒，松间好看卧云房。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20149,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南征 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"貔貅南出晋安门，剑戟如霜万马奔。\n小丑应须就殄灭，天威南面正乾坤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20150,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南征 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"君王南顾似深忧，每遣材官守赣州。\n多士能无见节义，诸公何意遁巢繇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20151,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南征 其三","author":"郑善夫","text":"将军自许霍嫖姚，豺虎山南尚尔骄。\n有人伊昔持干羽，不出阶除格有苗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20152,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南征 其四","author":"郑善夫","text":"官军不出粤山深，招抚年年空费心。\n天子拊髀思葛亮，南中孟获定成擒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20153,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南征 其五","author":"郑善夫","text":"纵使孙吴亲战阵，何如仇览在蒲亭。\n鸣枭亦化为鸾凤，农器宁销作甲兵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20154,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南征 其六","author":"郑善夫","text":"赣州城头鼓角哀，清漳道上羽书来。\n何处总戎深属望，阳明夫子出群材。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20155,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南征 其七","author":"郑善夫","text":"旌旗䓇䓇亘红云，钲鼓逢逢警六军。\n壮士不图收战骨，五陵豪贵策奇勋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20156,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昊天赠崔子","author":"薛蕙","text":"昊天单威，亦孔之棘。\n?莫有戾，不宁我国。\n我国斯瘼，我民用卒。\n如何昊天，云不我恤。\n国之方将，尚曰靡卜。\n国之既痗，伊何能谷。\n昊天降讻，弗遂弗畜。\n哀今之人，胡俾夭㭬。\n有萚者木，维其频矣。\n民之劬劳，不遑辰矣。\n戎作在圉，内有寇奸。\n王事弘多，宁有其殚。\n国既大废，君子于解。\n三事朋友，莫之能诲。\n卿士大夫，曰予弗逮。\n昊天鞠怒，则莫肯悔。\n忧心孔疚，念及我友。\n彼人有言，我孔之耻。\n曰予维服，忧我父母。\n舍是弗思，忧我天子。\n曰彼在位，曾不可耽。\n如贾弗售，载反其琛。\n懿尔君子，亦徂于南。\n送子出宿，悠悠我心。\n昔我迈矣，朋友相予。\n既愆于卒，我心如沮。\n匪往匪来，云我靡处。\n之子于行，忧心孔瘉。\n瞻卬昊天，则莫敢迩。\n既夷既届，则不我咎。\n君子于行，尚顾其后。\n大命不忒，爰其有止。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20157,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玄鸟赠蒋氏","author":"薛蕙","text":"翩翩玄鸟，秋日载徂。\n憔悴如何，不遑室家。\n悼我良朋，忧心瞿瞿。\n翩翩玄鸟，载徂秋日。\n憔悴如何，不遑家室。\n悼我良朋，忧心菀菀。\n翩翩玄鸟，迨春而复。\n之子于行，将其不觌。\n赠言匪多，忧心孔蹙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20158,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晋七贤图像诗","author":"薛蕙","text":"在昔有晋，多士间出。\n发挥上德，弥纶道术。\n遐踪齐骛，高轨竞轶。\n竹林之徒，厥维入室。\n阮公矫志，贵利弗就。\n流连沉湎，却彼婚媾。\n英材俶傥，殆乃天授。\n大人有传，跨腾宇宙。\n峨峨中散，龙章凤姿。\n彷徨丘泽，咀嚼云芝。\n神交隐沦，精感灵祗。\n解形东市，人靡能窥。\n邈矣参军，神栖亡愕。\n瞬息万代，跬步六漠。\n蔑盼贵介，眈彼三爵。\n裈中之谭，实维善谑。\n仲容秀发，颉颃叔父。\n神闇均律，妙洞击拊。\n郭奕心醉，荀勖妒嫭。\n始平之出，何其舛迕。\n向子清悟，庄惠同科。\n析辩神纬，扬此玄波。\n佐锻柳下，灌园岩阿。\n徘徊鸣笛，恻怆如何。\n巨源简静，夙怀高举。\n逡巡待价，仪刑朝序。\n拔材铨选，画议军旅。\n至道在躬，是曰馀绪。\n浚冲朗鉴，神量玄远。\n时哉多辟，降志舒卷。\n并美张裴，附交嵇阮。\n酒垆结恸，微情缱绻。\n川则珠辉，山维玉绚。\n猗嗟七子，亶时之彦。\n中行虽忒，聿恊狂狷。\n丹青式缋，精爽如见。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20159,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿顾华玉母分得云林夫人","author":"薛蕙","text":"金台曾构，瑶波潭沲。\n王母攸庐，问谁侍坐。\n姗姗季女，一何秀媠。\n乃曰云林，仙人字我。\n色侔琼蕊，云发翠妥。\n陵历沧浪，出入灵璅。\n凤飞戢孴，龙辀婀娜。\n却荫芝盖，俯拾玉果。\n圃有洪桃，花萼未堕。\n纷纭周汉，闇如石火。\n湘灵举楫，洛妃拥柁。\n曩栖海右，今遨江左。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20160,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"顾东江先生遗善堂诗 其一","author":"薛蕙","text":"纷纶灵系，昭晰瑞图。\n在昔帝喾，爰及昆吾。\n嘉祥诞发，茂庆攸敷。\n比晖四姓，著美三吴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20161,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]